{
	"title": "Compléter un tableau croisé avec une fréquence conditionnelle",
	"description": "Marges données et « p % des filles » : cases du tableau croisé",
	"grades": ["2"],
	"theme": "Statistiques",
	"domain": "Tableaux croisés",
	"subdomain": "Fréquences conditionnelles",
	"level": 3,
	"delay": 150,
	"status": "draft",
	"shared": {
		"blankDefaults": {
			"acceptDecimal": true
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Dans un lycée, on a relevé le sexe et le régime des élèves. On sait que **${{pf}}\\,\\%$ des filles** sont internes.\n\n```tableau-croise\nlignes: Filles ; Garçons\ncolonnes: Interne ; Externe\nFilles = {{fi}} ; {{fx}}\nGarçons = {{gi}} ; {{gx}}\ncoin: Sexe \\ Régime\nmasquer: Filles/Interne ; Filles/Externe ; Garçons/Interne ; Garçons/Externe\n```\n\nComplète le tableau.\n\nFilles internes : $?$\n\nGarçons internes : $?$\n\nGarçons externes : $?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "3..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "2..12"
				},
				{
					"name": "pf",
					"expression": "eval:5*(r)"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "3..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "tf",
					"expression": "eval:20*(a)"
				},
				{
					"name": "tg",
					"expression": "eval:20*(b)"
				},
				{
					"name": "fi",
					"expression": "eval:(tf)*(pf)/100"
				},
				{
					"name": "gi",
					"expression": "4..50"
				},
				{
					"name": "fx",
					"expression": "eval:(tf)-(fi)"
				},
				{
					"name": "gx",
					"expression": "eval:(tg)-(gi)"
				},
				{
					"name": "ti",
					"expression": "eval:(fi)+(gi)"
				},
				{
					"name": "tx",
					"expression": "eval:(fx)+(gx)"
				},
				{
					"name": "nt",
					"expression": "eval:(tf)+(tg)"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["gi < tg", "gi != fi"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{fi}}"
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{gi}}"
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{gx}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"« ${{pf}}\\,\\%$ des filles » : le pourcentage porte sur les **${{tf}}$ filles**, pas sur tout le lycée.",
					"Filles internes : ${{eval:(pf)/100;d}}\\times{{tf}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{fi}}}$.",
					"Garçons internes : ${{ti}}-{{fi}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{gi}}}$ ; garçons externes : ${{tg}}-{{gi}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{gx}}}$.",
					"```tableau-croise\nlignes: Filles ; Garçons\ncolonnes: Interne ; Externe\nFilles = {{fi}} ; {{fx}}\nGarçons = {{gi}} ; {{gx}}\ncoin: Sexe \\ Régime\n```"
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"testSpecs": [
		{
			"description": "30 % de 100 filles = 30 ; 50 − 30 = 20 ; 80 − 20 = 60",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"a": "5",
				"r": "6",
				"pf": "30",
				"b": "4",
				"tf": "100",
				"tg": "80",
				"fi": "30",
				"gi": "20",
				"fx": "70",
				"gx": "60",
				"ti": "50",
				"tx": "130",
				"nt": "180"
			},
			"answers": ["30", "20", "60"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 30 % de tout le lycée (54)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"a": "5",
				"r": "6",
				"pf": "30",
				"b": "4",
				"tf": "100",
				"tg": "80",
				"fi": "30",
				"gi": "20",
				"fx": "70",
				"gx": "60",
				"ti": "50",
				"tx": "130",
				"nt": "180"
			},
			"answers": ["54", "-4", "84"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 30 % des garçons aussi (24)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"a": "5",
				"r": "6",
				"pf": "30",
				"b": "4",
				"tf": "100",
				"tg": "80",
				"fi": "30",
				"gi": "20",
				"fx": "70",
				"gx": "60",
				"ti": "50",
				"tx": "130",
				"nt": "180"
			},
			"answers": ["30", "24", "56"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		}
	]
}
